# The images need only the package sources, the project metadata, and the lockfile.
# Everything else is excluded, so local state (.venv, .dvf, reports, .env files) never
# reaches a build context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!src/

**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
src/dvf/_version.py
